!! Callout boxes

```
<$transclude $tiddler="$:/plugins/rimir/theme/callout" type="info">
<$fill $name="body">This is an informational callout.</$fill>
</$transclude>

<$transclude $tiddler="$:/plugins/rimir/theme/callout" type="warning" label="Caution">
<$fill $name="body">This callout has a custom label.</$fill>
</$transclude>

<$transclude $tiddler="$:/plugins/rimir/theme/callout" type="danger">
<$fill $name="body">Danger callout for critical warnings.</$fill>
</$transclude>

<$transclude $tiddler="$:/plugins/rimir/theme/callout" type="tip">
<$fill $name="body">A helpful tip for the reader.</$fill>
</$transclude>
```

!! Tab bar

```
<div class="rr-tabs">
  <$button class="rr-tab rr-tab-active" set="$:/state/demo-tab" setTo="one">Tab 1</$button>
  <$button class="rr-tab" set="$:/state/demo-tab" setTo="two">Tab 2</$button>
</div>
<$reveal state="$:/state/demo-tab" type="match" text="one" default="one">
Content for tab 1.
</$reveal>
<$reveal state="$:/state/demo-tab" type="match" text="two">
Content for tab 2.
</$reveal>
```

